 orders by pincode, product, and cohort`,`Generate a courier-wise RTO report and suggest reallocation`,`Find repeat-offender customers and update the blocklist`]},{title:`Checkout Funnel Diagnostics`,description:`Find drop-offs, gateway failures, and coupon issues in checkout.`,icon:(0,$.jsx)(CC,{}),prompts:[`Show step-wise checkout drop-off vs baseline`,`Correlate today's drop spike with gateway failures`,`Summarize the latest A/B test and which arm won`,`Audit coupons for conflicts, stacking loopholes, or dead codes`,`Compute true recovered revenue from recovery campaigns`]},{title:`Order & Payment Ops Reconciliation`,description:`Match settlements, clear refund queues, and catch stuck orders.`,icon:(0,$.jsx)(wC,{}),prompts:[`Match settlements to orders and flag mismatches`,`Process the refund/cancellation queue with approvals`,`Find stuck orders (payment captured, no order) and retry`,`Give me today's prepaid vs COD split, AOV, and method mix`,`Check inventory sync errors blocking checkout on live SKUs`]},{title:`Customer Comms & Post-Purchase`,description:`Proactive shipping updates, ticket triage, and win-backs.`,icon:(0,$.jsx)(TC,{}),prompts:[`Send shipping-delay notifications based on tracking status`,`Triage this support ticket and draft a first response`,`Run a win-back sequence for canceled/RTO'd first orders`,`Summarize this week's NPS/review themes by product`,`Update customers on refund status from the payment ledger`]}],layout:`grid`}}[mr.trim().toLowerCase()]??{categories:bC,layout:`grid`},DC=EC.categories;function OC(e){let t=(0,Q.c)(20),{category:n,active:r,index:i,onClick:a}=e,o=`category-card category-card--embedded${r?` category-card--active`:``}`,s;t[0]===n.backgroundColor?s=t[1]:(s=n.backgroundColor?{"--card-bg":n.backgroundColor}:void 0,t[0]=n.backgroundColor,t[1]=s);let c=`${i*.4}s`,l;t[2]===c?l=t[3]:(l={"--gleam-delay":c},t[2]=c,t[3]=l);let u=l,d;t[4]!==n.icon||t[5]!==u?(d=(0,$.jsx)(`div`,{className:`category-card-icon category-card-icon--em